WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
Venezuelans are dying in huge amounts.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.160
Stossel: Venezuela was once the richest country

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.620
in Latin America.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:10.100
It still has the world’s biggest oil reserves.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.820
But 20 years ago, Venezuelans voted for socialism.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:16.040
They elected Hugo Chavez.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.860
Some Americans were excited about that.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.400
Model Naomi Campbell visited Chavez

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.780
calling him “a rebel angel.”

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:25.520
Jimmy Kimmel: This is you and Hugo Chavez.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.220
Michael Moore: [laughing]

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.440
Oh Michael Moore! Michael Moore!

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.400
Kimmel: Really?

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.620
He says, “help me write my speech.”

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.960
He is one of the most important forces

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.100
we've had on this planet.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.600
And even today, as Venezuela collapses,

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.360
many Americans say, don’t blame socialism.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.480
Actually, blaming socialism

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.360
for Venezuela’s riches to rags story

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.040
is grossly misleading.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.680
Yes, Venezuela is going through

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.780
an insane political crisis right now.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.540
But it’s not clear that that crisis

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.140
has anything to do with their socialist policies.

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:57.560
Stossel: This popular video,

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:00.440
“the collapse of Venezuela explained”

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:03.160
never once mentions “socialism.”

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.460
Vox Anchor: “Oil prices plummeted in 2014

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.180
and Maduro failed to adjust.”

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.780
Stossel: Media personalities suggest

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:13.520
only conservatives say Socialism destroyed Venezuela.

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.200
John Oliver: If you follow conservative media at all

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.960
you might have seen it frequently painted as the

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.800
inevitable dire consequences of a socialist government.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.620
Stossel: The problem isn’t Socialism, says John Oliver

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:26.420
John Oliver: It’s a story about epic mismanagement.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.880
But mismanagement is what happens

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.740
under socialist governments.

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:32.180
It always happens

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.400
because no group of central planners

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.680
is wise enough to manage an entire economy.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.900
Even if they have good intentions,

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.000
Stossel: the socialists eventually run out

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.520
of other people’s money.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.060
The socialists solution then is to print more.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:48.540
[sound of money printing]

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:50.560
That caused massive inflation.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.660
The nation’s failed economy is expected

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:56.140
to hit 10 million percent inflation this year.

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.780
Stossel: When business owners raised prices

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.200
to keep up with inflation government often

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.720
took away their businesses.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.360
Chavez [in Spanish]: What is this?

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.460
Response [in Spanish]: A private business.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.000
Chavez [in Spanish]: Expropriate it.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.920
[crying businessman]

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.560
Stossel: This man’s just had his business taken

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.060
[crying businessman]

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:16.980
Stossel: Socialist say government can run

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:19.580
businesses better than greedy owners

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:21.740
who just want profit.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:24.060
And even though that led to tyranny

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:28.120
in Venezuela, and China, and Russia, Korea, Vietnam,

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.760
Cambodia and Cuba…

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.720
There are plenty of socialist countries

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:33.440
that look nothing like Venezuela.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:35.620
When I talk about Democratic Socialism

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:37.660
I am not looking at Venezuela

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:39.120
I’m not looking at Cuba.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.360
I’m looking at countries like Denmark and Sweden

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.880
[Swedish folk music]

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.880
Stossel: Oh yes, those counties do have bigger

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:49.300
welfare programs than America does.

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.600
but they are not socialist.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.900
They make a point of saying that.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.640
Here’s Denmarks prime minister

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:59.680
Denmark is far from a socialist planned economy.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:01.740
Denmark is a market economy.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:04.660
Not only that, lately, they’ve reduced

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.980
government control of their economy.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.380
They privatized the national phone system,

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:12.660
and the railroads and they sold Copenhagen airport

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.260
to a private company.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.660
It’s the same story in Sweden.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.000
Johan Norberg: We did have a period

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.260
in the 1970s and 1980s

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:23.060
when we had something that resembled socialism -

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:25.620
a big government that taxed and spent heavily.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.280
And that's the period in Swedish history

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.620
when our economy was going south.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.720
[people cheering]

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.980
Stossel: So Sweden reduced government’s role too.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.520
They even instituted school choice

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.400
The Scandinavian countries that progressives call

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.120
"socialist successes"

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.620
Not only are they not socialist—

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:45.380
They’re moving more toward Capitalism.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:49.360
[chanting in Spanish]

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:51.260
Stossel: The silver lining in Venezuela’s collapse

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:53.320
is that most Venezuelans who escaped

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.160
their country’s socialism

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:57.640
do understand what went wrong.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.900
In Florida, reporter Gloria Alvarez

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.760
asked Venezuelan immigrants

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:04.040
What do you think about socialism?

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:05.640
That doesn't work.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.800
I wouldn't recommend it to anyone.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.000
It's never going to work.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.080
It's never gonna work.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.640
Do you think that people

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.320
once they get out of Venezuela,

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:14.700
do they understand that the

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.520
problem is socialism?

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.220
I think that a great percentage of them do.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.660
The problem is the socialist system

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.120
that they tried to make work but that has never worked,

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.280
and will never work.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.100
It will never work

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.240
as Ludwig von Mises wrote,

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.320
"The champions of socialism promise

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:34.140
the Garden of Eden, but plan to transform the world into

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.000
a gigantic post office.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.480
Every man a subordinate clerk."

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:42.160
I wish progressives understood that.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.340
Since they don’t

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:48.500
tragedies like Venezuela will happen again and again.

